{
  "$schema": "https://schema.tauri.app/config/2",
  "_comment": [
    "macOS-only Tauri override config. Pass to tauri build via:",
    "  npm run tauri build -- --target aarch64-apple-darwin --bundles dmg --config src-tauri/tauri.macos.conf.json",
    "",
    "与主 tauri.conf.json 的差异：",
    "  - 不打包 WebView2Loader.dll（macOS 用 WKWebView，系统自带）",
    "  - bundle.targets 只列 dmg（macOS 上 NSIS 不适用）",
    "  - bundle.macOS 设置 minimumSystemVersion=11.0（Big Sur 起 WKWebView 稳定）",
    "  - ico 图标换成 icns（macOS 应用图标标准）",
    "",
    "本文件作为 CI 默认配置存在；要差异化打包请另起 *.conf.json。"
  ],
  "productName": "ZCode Switcher",
  "version": "1.1.15+43",
  "identifier": "com.zcode.switcher",
  "build": {
    "beforeDevCommand": "npm run dev",
    "devUrl": "http://localhost:1420",
    "beforeBuildCommand": "npm run build",
    "frontendDist": "../dist"
  },
  "app": {
    "windows": [
      {
        "title": "ZCode Switcher",
        "width": 960,
        "height": 780,
        "minWidth": 760,
        "minHeight": 560,
        "resizable": true,
        "transparent": true,
        "center": true
      }
    ],
    "trayIcon": {
      "iconPath": "icons/32x32.png",
      "iconAsTemplate": true,
      "menuOnLeftClick": false,
      "title": "ZCode Switcher"
    },
    "security": {
      "csp": null
    }
  },
  "bundle": {
    "active": true,
    "targets": ["dmg"],
    "createUpdaterArtifacts": true,
    "macOS": {
      "minimumSystemVersion": "11.0"
    },
    "icon": [
      "icons/32x32.png",
      "icons/128x128.png",
      "icons/128x128@2x.png",
      "icons/icon.icns"
    ]
  },
  "plugins": {
    "deep-link": {
      "desktop": {
        "schemes": ["zcode"]
      }
    }
  }
}
